Mission statement:
- All features and bonuses from homeworks
- 60fps on my weak notebook in 1280x720p.
- 60fps on my powerful notebook in 1920x1080p with raytraced reflections.

This is a renderer for getting familiar with graphics and it's problems.
It will not be optimal, very user friendly or free of bugs and issues.
It will be considered done once reasonably renders all the required features in the
chosen configuration on all selected scenes with reasonable framerate. 

